Create multiple Route53 DNS records usin:
resource "aws_route53_record" "records" {
  for_each = { for r in var.records : "${r.name}-${r.type}" => r }
  zone_id  = var.zone_id
  name     = each.value.name
  type     = each.value.type
  ttl      = 300
  records  = each.value.values
}
This creates one record per entry in var.records, keyed uniquely by name+type so records with the same name but different types (A, TXT, CNAME) don't collide in the for_each map.
